{"id":"tr-10-001","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"big island in the middle, tan colour"}
{"id":"tr-10-002","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"now a ship, small brown one, bottom left out at sea"}
{"id":"tr-10-003","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"Skull Cove on the west side of the island, a gray circle"}
{"id":"tr-10-004","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"and a red star where the treasure is, top of the island. call it X"}
{"id":"tr-10-005","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"dotted line from the ship to Skull Cove"}
{"id":"tr-10-006","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"hm that island is huge, it covers the ship almost"}
{"id":"tr-10-007","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"smaller. no a bit bigger than that"}
{"id":"tr-10-008","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"three palm trees, green, along the south beach"}
{"id":"tr-10-009","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"Then the trail. Cove to the first palm, palm to the second, and on to X"}
{"id":"tr-10-010","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"wait the trail is straight lines, pirates don't walk like that. can they be dashed too"}
{"id":"tr-10-011","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"Undo that"}
{"id":"tr-10-012","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"no I meant undo the dashed, keep the trail"}
{"id":"tr-10-013","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"title at the top: Captain Morgan's Last Hope"}
{"id":"tr-10-014","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"how many palm trees is that now"}
{"id":"tr-10-015","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"make X bigger, you can't see it"}
{"id":"tr-10-016","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"ship should say Black Pearl"}
{"id":"tr-10-017","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","text":"ok that's the map, thanks, my son will love it"}
{"id":"tr-10-018","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"I need a release checklist. start with a box that says Freeze branch"}
{"id":"tr-10-019","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"Run tests under that"}
{"id":"tr-10-020","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"then Build artifacts, then Sign, then Upload"}
{"id":"tr-10-021","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"arrows down the whole thing please"}
{"id":"tr-10-022","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"they're all different widths, ugly"}
{"id":"tr-10-023","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"Run tests can fail. add a red one off to the side called Fix and back"}
{"id":"tr-10-024","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"back to where"}
{"id":"tr-10-025","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"no, you made it go to Freeze branch. I meant back to Run tests"}
{"id":"tr-10-026","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"Green for the ones done so far: freeze and tests"}
{"id":"tr-10-027","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"Upload should say Publish instead"}
{"id":"tr-10-028","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"after Sign a small diamond, Approved?"}
{"id":"tr-10-029","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"yes goes to Publish, no goes to Fix"}
{"id":"tr-10-030","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"which of these has two arrows leaving it?"}
{"id":"tr-10-031","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"Everything in one frame, call it Friday release"}
{"id":"tr-10-032","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"sorry, remove the frame, it covers the arrows"}
{"id":"tr-10-033","domain":"release checklist","kind":"session","session":"release-checklist","text":"good. now a note at the bottom: ask Dana before pushing"}
